# About the project button

Case-detail **About the project** uses the global **OriginButton** (`components/ui/origin-button.tsx`). Do not restyle it locally.

## Keep (do not rip out)

- Sticky pin in the case body (`.project-case-demo__toggle-pin`)
- Open / close (`is-open`, panel push)
- Panel push / mobile sheet behavior

## Do not

- Wrap it in ClickSpark
- Bring back the + / × icon or rotate animation
- Bring back liquid-glass, GlareHover wipe, difference-blend contrast layers, or luminance `is-on-light` swaps
- Override OriginButton fill / radius / type with local CSS
